      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAYDEN'S MILK (1) has been in super consistent form recently with three minors on end before breaking through for an overdue win (16.91) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Drawn the rails and rates a key runner. BINNAWAY PEARL (3) goes very well this course and distance starting 10 times for five wins and four minors. Below best last time at Murray Bridge (22.47) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 7 length fourth. Looks well placed here and among the chances. GIN AND JUICE (7) has a terrific record this track and trip with three wins and six placings from nine starts. Recorded a nose win (16.45) in a OPEN last time at this track. Can feature with the right run. BEAST CUT LOOSE (5) placed last time (16.72) at this track in a OPEN, finishing second and beaten a neck. Has already won five times from this draw.",
